<title>USA: West Fargo, N.D., won by Isaak Bond.</title>
<headline>West Fargo, N.D., won by Isaak Bond.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isaak Bond said it won $1.500 million of West Fargo, N.D., general obligation arterial bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.966 percent.</p>
</text>
